589"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Pode ser que fique tão furiosa que comece uma guerra!","e":"She might even be angry enough to declare war!","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.774389,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"bf6289a4ed90c723630ee60547b1f894","i":"3241d569729f9cc288922349a4838a16","r":"4731502:6538567:437:2925405","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4731502","6538567","437"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Estava furiosa comigo porque matei as plantas dela.","e":"She got mad at me 'cause I killed all of her plants.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.81284,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"bad8d9f04742d46d5ce3f0f05ab091b1","i":"76a8f2d536ee30b9a1eaa73afb440aa0","r":"5087554:6836543:170:2129398","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5087554","6836543","170"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"E também está furiosa porque sabe que eu não sou o único.","e":"And she's also angry because she knows I'm not the only one.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.894222,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"5cd2711790d0566de461c28af2ba40b1","i":"86b115d6e8ff0ea885f17b73a0375aa7","r":"4278508:6652063:539:1238502","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4278508","6652063","539"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Ela estava... estava furiosa porque a Polícia apareceu na escola dela.","e":"She's, um... she's pissed because the police are showing up at her school.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.873037,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"af3ba54eff9636a2b51987e6af1601c8","i":"99125086b75ca0e470bee581b00c298a","r":"4924708:6548216:882:3087649","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4924708","6548216","882"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Mas sou humana e estou furiosa com ele.","e":"But I am only human, and I am so mad at him.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.