blema que as tribos tinham.","e":"You see, we have the same problem that the tribes did.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.817104,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"85e5ecd6a576edac096c12c542275e34","i":"af55fa7236a8805e42818c7e3f1bff68","r":"5972632:6984682:392:4819434","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5972632","6984682","392"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"As tribos vieram todas ver o casamento da vossa irmã.","e":"All the tribes have come to see your sister marry.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.834985,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"9c892e02cf4ff65b66b31a7617063210","i":"d48dd9c8dffde9eb7e65436c6ac40647","r":"4508650:6557699:107:2754343","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4508650","6557699","107"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Convenci as outras tribos a lutar com os demónios.","e":"I've convinced the other tribes to fight the Demons.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.8593,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"71e6d2ac30fc58de59f133573106eba1","i":"99da1cea09762fc53a004bdf1eac8be9","r":"4284262:6788561:336:2655817","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4284262","6788561","336"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Duas tribos rivais decidiram combinar o seu poder.","e":"Two rival tribes decided to combine their power.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.884294,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"5c139e9dbb31ee939c8e4a2d57eb3e50","i":"bdd87d34556a60543f7349b0bd73babc","r":"5972632:6984682:191:4819245","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5972632","6984682","191"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Se isto se espalhar, destruirá a união das 12 tribos.","e":"Oh, if this gets out, it will destroy the union of the 12 tribes.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.778545,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"c51519a46b95aa578fee221a221eacf3